# Pre-commit dependency pins

- When `hookpin` cannot resolve an `additional_dependencies` pin against `uv.lock`, including a type-stub package only mypy uses, add the package to the dev dependency group in `pyproject.toml` and run `uv lock`.
- Never fix it by hand-editing the version pin in `.pre-commit-config.yaml`.

Why: `hookpin` verifies every pin against the lockfile, so a package missing from it fails however the pin is written.

## Checks
- enforced-by-hook: hookpin
- enforcement: llm-review
